<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=F0=9F=92=A1 <strong>Production =
Lesson</strong>: DNS chains &gt;3 hops significantly impact performance. We=
 optimized by using ALIAS records.</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=92=AD Principal=
